WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.265
Only add coefficients of like terms. Constants combine with constants, and x-terms

00:00:05.265 --> 00:00:06.109
with x-terms.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:14.642
Simplify 5x plus 5x plus 7 minus 8. The answer is 10x minus 1. Combine x-terms (5

00:00:14.642 --> 00:00:17.809
plus 5)x and constants 7 minus 8.

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:24.803
A learner in a craft workshop combines 8x plus 6 plus 4x minus 7. Which simplified

00:00:24.803 --> 00:00:27.897
expression is correct? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:35.127
A learner in a craft workshop combines 8x plus 6 plus 4x minus 7. Which simplified

00:00:35.127 --> 00:00:41.152
expression is correct? The answer is 12x minus 1. Combine x-terms (8 plus 4)x and

00:00:41.152 --> 00:00:42.759
constants 6 minus 7.
